# ROS 2 control_msgs messages in the JSON form of a rosbridge `publish` operation.
# Generated by tools/gen/ros2msg2pack.py; do not edit by hand.
# One kind per .msg file, selected by the member `type` ("<package>/msg/<Name>").
# The ROS message is the object under `msg`; arrays are groups.
format        ros2-control-msgs
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "ROS 2 interface package control_msgs, https://github.com/ros-controls/control_msgs jazzy (BSD 3-Clause License) at commit ab911bf0746fb064b1a88a2c0d364d6b7abd477b, directory control_msgs/msg; field names, types and array forms only"
source        "ROS 2 interface package builtin_interfaces (messages control_msgs refers to), https://github.com/ros2/rcl_interfaces 2.0.4 at commit 7aa3caf43377ea6ad615bc1040832e2c7566bfbe, Apache License 2.0"
source        "ROS 2 interface package geometry_msgs (messages control_msgs refers to), https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces 5.3.8 at commit a941f14bb318d8d904505ed935ccbb97f24a70a4, Apache License 2.0"
source        "ROS 2 interface package sensor_msgs (messages control_msgs refers to), https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces 5.3.8 at commit a941f14bb318d8d904505ed935ccbb97f24a70a4, Apache License 2.0"
source        "ROS 2 interface package std_msgs (messages control_msgs refers to), https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces 5.3.8 at commit a941f14bb318d8d904505ed935ccbb97f24a70a4, Apache License 2.0"
source        "ROS 2 interface package trajectory_msgs (messages control_msgs refers to), https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces 5.3.8 at commit a941f14bb318d8d904505ed935ccbb97f24a70a4, Apache License 2.0"
source        "rosbridge v2.1.0 Protocol Specification, ROSBRIDGE_PROTOCOL.md, https://github.com/RobotWebTools/rosbridge_suite jazzy at commit cb33a16b890e4b8d9def531326409f3ee6c12537, BSD 3-Clause License; JSON form of a message and of the publish operation"
uses          ros2control
wire          json
when   op  publish
field  ros2control.topic  topic  string

